/* 城镇暗线剧本库 V2 / 6条线 × 7段 / NPC引路·检查·失败代价·分档结局 */
:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestCellar or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	走廊尽头的木门今天没有上锁。
门缝里吹出一股潮气，混着旧樟脑和湿石头的味道。
「昨晚贝利让人搬下去两只箱子，」罗宾压低声音，「搬上来只有一只。」
你把耳朵贴近门板。里面没有人声，只有水一滴一滴落进铁桶。
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[撬开木门 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[先问罗宾 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarRobin to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[从门缝里看 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarPeek to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
你回到走廊尽头。木门还虚掩着，门后的潮气比刚才更重。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续下窖 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
你回到旧储物室的暗门前，指尖还留着石阶上的凉意。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[接着往下查 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
账册残页还在你贴身的内袋里。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回储藏室翻账册 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
你已经把残页上的名字对上了两处封印。铁皮箱还在木架后面。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去开那只铁皮箱 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
铁皮箱的盖子已经被你撬松。楼上有人拖过一把椅子。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把最后几页取出来 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
账册与收据都在你身上。走廊尽头传来贝利皮鞋踩过木地板的声响。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[从暗门退出去 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
旧储物室已经被你翻查干净。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼暗门 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 2)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
门后是一段向下的窄梯，墙皮被水汽泡得发软。尽头有一盏没有点亮的煤油灯，灯座旁压着半盒受潮的火柴。
<<if $mpTownCellarRobin is 1>>
	罗宾跟到楼梯口就停住了，手指绞着围裙角：「我在这儿听着。要是上面有人下来，我敲两下门框。」
<<elseif $mpTownCellarPeek is 1>>
	你刚才从门缝里看见的，是两只叠在一起的木箱和一条拖过地面的旧划痕。现在那条划痕就在你脚边。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[摸黑往下走 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<stress 2>><<else>><<set $mpTownCellarNerve to 1>><<stress 5>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[点亮煤油灯 (0:08)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 8>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[先听下面的动静 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpTownCellarListen to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
半地下的储藏室里码着旧床架、坏掉的木马和一摞发霉的床单。最里面那只木架与地面之间有一道半圆形的刮痕。
你刚把木架挪开半尺，头顶就传来脚步声。有人在走廊里停住了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "查看门锁 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step3">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 240>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_cellar_hidden"] to 1>>
	你缩进木架与墙之间的缝隙，把呼吸压到最浅。门缝里晃过一盏灯，灯光在石阶上停了一会儿，又慢慢移开。
	<<stress 2>>
木架后面露出一扇嵌在石墙里的橡木窄门，门锁上积着薄灰。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看门锁 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[先躲开上面的人 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownCellarNoise to 1>>
	你后退时膝盖撞上一只空铁桶。桶身滚过半圈，发出一声闷响。上面的脚步立刻加快，你只来得及躲到床架后面。
	<<stress 6>><<pain 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
窄门后面是一间更小的石室。地上散着被撕碎的账页，墙角有一只铅封铁皮箱。你从碎纸里拼出半本收养登记册，纸页边缘用暗红墨水写着两个缩写：一个像学园的旧纹章，一个像神殿的蜡印。
<<if $mpTownCellarListen is 1>>
	你刚才听见的，是楼上有人在说「学园那边的旧档」。现在这句话和纸上的缩写对上了。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[比对学园纹章 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_school"] to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarLead to "school">><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[比对神殿蜡印 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_temple"] to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarLead to "temple">><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[只抄下人名 (0:08)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_names"] to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarLead to "names">><<pass 8>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
铁皮箱的锁是老式的双排弹子。你蹲下去时，石室外面又传来一次脚步声，这次更近。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step5">
<<sneakicon>><<link "用发夹拨动双排弹子 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 650>><<set _reward to 450>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 300>><<else>><<set _reward to 180>><</if>>
	锁舌轻轻弹开。箱里是几封匿名汇款单、一把黄铜小钥匙，还有一小卷用油纸包好的旧钞。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_cellar_key")>>
		<<set $mpFragLedgerKey to ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_cellar_receipts"] to 1>>
	<<money _reward>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[把收据收好 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[再从暗门听一听 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpTownCellarHeard to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownCellarCaught to 1>>
	锁芯卡住了。你用力一拧，铁皮箱里发出一声脆响，像是某根细簧断了。门外的人停下脚步，手已经搭上门把。
	<<stress 7>><<pain 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[贴到门后 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[先开口应付 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 3>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarCaught is 1>>
	门开了。贝利站在门口，手里提着一盏罩着黑布的灯。贝利没有立刻进来，只把灯举高，让光从你脸上慢慢移到身后的铁皮箱。
	「这么晚，」贝利说，「你在找什么？」
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[说在找洗衣单 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 350>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "bluff">><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_bluff"] to 1>><<stress 2>><<else>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "caught">><<stress 7>><<trauma 2>><</if>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[从煤槽钻出去 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "escape">><<pass 6>><<pain 3>><<stress 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把账册交出去 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "surrender">><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_school"] to 0>><<pass 3>><<stress 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你把账页、收据和黄铜小钥匙分开放进衣袋。暗门外传来贝利的声音，像是在跟谁交代「明天把旧储物室清空」。
	<<if $mpTownCellarHeard is 1>>
		你听见另一个更轻的声音应了一声。那是塞拉。她说明天会把钟表铺后间的灯留到很晚。
		<<set $mpClues["town_cellar_sera"] to 1>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把账册交给罗宾 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "robin">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[自己留下账册 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "keep">><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[把账册放回原处 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "return">><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_cellar_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_hidden"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_receipts"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_school"] or $mpClues["town_cellar_temple"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_sera"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome is "robin" or $mpTownCellarOutcome is "keep">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($willpower or 0), ($english or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2400>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1800>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1300>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 900>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome is "surrender" or $mpTownCellarOutcome is "caught">><<set _reward to Math.floor(_reward / 2)>><</if>>
你把暗门恢复原状，从走廊尽头退出来。
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome is "robin">>
罗宾在楼梯口等你，接过账册时手指有点抖。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "keep">>
你把账册藏进自己床板的夹层。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "return">>
你把账册放回铁皮箱，只带走了黄铜小钥匙。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "bluff">>
贝利盯着你看了很久，最后侧身让开半步。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "surrender">>
贝利把账册收进外套内袋，语气平静得像在吩咐一件家务：「明天开始，走廊的灯由你关。」你空着手走出来，至少人还在。
<<else>>
你从煤槽爬出来时蹭了一身煤灰。贝利没有追，只在你身后把暗门重新锁上。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome isnot "surrender" and $mpTownCellarOutcome isnot "caught">>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_cellar_complete")>>
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
你把能从账册里对上的名字抄在一张薄纸上。
<<else>>
	你只记住了几个被涂黑一半的名字。它们还够用。
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
	你从这趟暗门后面的旧账里拿到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
	<<money _reward>><<stress -6>><<trauma -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
你又把账页翻了一遍，只确认了先前记下的名字。
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好账页离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[再核对一遍账页 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestAttic or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	天花板角落的活板门今天比平时沉。
你一拉麻绳，细灰就簌簌落下来。阁楼里很安静，只有风从瓦缝里挤过去的轻响。罗宾说过，这间房以前住过一个叫玛拉的女孩。她走的那天，只带走了一只小箱子。
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[趁夜拽开活板门 (0:06)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<pass 6>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<set $mpTownAtticNight to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><</if>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[直接拽开活板门 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<set $mpTownAtticHaste to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[先敲敲横梁 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<set $mpTownAtticKnock to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	阁楼的木梯已经放下来，灰尘在斜射的光里慢慢飘。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[爬上去 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	旧皮箱还搁在房梁下面，铜锁链上有一层新蹭掉的灰。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回到箱子旁 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	日记摊在你膝头。纸页间的潮气已经散了，字迹却比刚才更清楚。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续读日记 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	日记最后一页夹着一张折过的草图，边角磨得发毛。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[展开那张草图 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	楼梯上传来脚步声。活板门还开着一条缝。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[先躲到梁后 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	你把能找到的东西都收在怀里。楼下的人已经走到走廊尽头。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[从活板门下去 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	阁楼里只剩一层薄灰和空箱子。玛拉留下的东西已经不在原处。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼空箱 (0:03)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 2)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
阁楼比你想的矮。斜屋顶下堆着旧衣架、断了腿的椅子，还有一只缠着铜锁链的皮箱。箱盖上落着一层灰，灰上有几道新鲜的指印。
<<if $mpTownAtticHaste is 1>>
	你上来得太急，肩膀撞到横梁，一片灰落进领口。
	<<pain 1>><<stress 1>>
<<elseif $mpTownAtticKnock is 1>>
	你敲过的那根横梁是空的。里面有什么东西轻轻滚了一下，又停住。
<</if>>
<br><br>
皮箱的锁是老式的，锁孔里没有钥匙。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "稳住心神上前 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 240>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_attic_lock"] to 1>>
	你用发卡拨开锁舌，铜链滑落时只发出很轻的一声。
	<<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[打开皮箱 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownAtticStuck to 1>>
	发卡在锁孔里折断了。你用力扯了一下铜链，箱子纹丝不动，楼下却传来一声开门响。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[用蛮力撬锁 (0:07)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpTownAtticForce to 1>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[下楼找工具 (0:06)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpTownAtticTool to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准动静再试 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
皮箱里铺着一层褪色的天鹅绒。上面放着一本硬皮日记、一只银顶针，还有一束用红线扎着的干花。
日记的扉页写着「玛拉·W」，下面有一行被水洇开的字：『如果我没回来，别让他们把井填上。』
<<if $mpTownAtticForce is 1>>
	锁扣被你撬弯了，箱盖边缘留下一道新痕。你尽量把痕迹按回原样。
	<<stress 2>>
<<elseif $mpTownAtticTool is 1>>
	你从楼下工具箱里找到一把小撬棍，箱盖开得很干净。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[读日记 (0:08)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($english or 0) gte 280 or ($history or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_mara"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_sketch"] to 1>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先看那只银顶针 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4]]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_thimble"] to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_mara"]>>
	日记断断续续。玛拉写过洗衣房、写过冬天的热水，也写过一个总在花园枯井边等她的男人。最后一页只有一句话：『他给我的齿轮不是纪念品，是钥匙。』
<<else>>
	你没完全读懂那些字。但画很直白：一口井，井壁上有七道横刻；井底旁边画着一只带齿的小圆盘。
<</if>>
你把日记翻到中间，发现装订线被拆开过。线缝里夹着一片薄铜片，上面刻着和钟表铺橱窗里那只怀表相同的星象刻度。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[抽出铜片 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_gear"] to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[翻到最后一页 (0:06)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_well"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把日记合上 (0:03)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<set $mpTownAtticMercy to 1>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_well"]>>
	草图上的井就在孤儿院后花园。井壁七道横刻，对应七块松动的砖。玛拉在角落写了「第三块」。
<<else>>
	铜片背面刻着一串很小的数字，像是钟表铺的零件编号。你把它翻过来时，边缘割了一下指腹。
	<<pain 1>>
<</if>>
楼梯上传来脚步声。这次不是路过，是有人在上楼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "把日记藏好 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_attic_hidden"] to 1>>
	你把日记塞进梁上的旧衣堆，自己缩到烟囱后面的阴影里。门被推开，有人在屋里站了一会儿，又关上门走了。
	<<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[把日记藏好 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[从活板门下去 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownAtticSeen to 1>>
	你后退时踩到一块松动的木板。门下的影子停住，接着门把转动了半圈。
	<<stress 6>><<pain 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准位置再试 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticSeen is 1>>
	门开了。站在门口的是贝利。贝利看了看你，又看了看你身后的阁楼。
	「上面不安全，」贝利说，「下来。」
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[顺从地下去 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "bailey">><<pass 4>><<stress 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[说在找旧衣服 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "bluff">><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[从屋顶气窗绕出去 (0:07)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "roof">><<pass 7>><<pain 3>><<stress 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你把日记重新包好。楼下传来罗宾的声音，罗宾在喊你的名字，说厨房留了汤。
	日记最后一页的地址就在孤儿院后花园。你可以现在去，也可以把它交给别人。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[把日记交给罗宾 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "robin">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[自己留下日记 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "keep">><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[把日记放回箱子 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "return">><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_attic_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_mara"] or $mpClues["town_attic_sketch"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_gear"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_well"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_hidden"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome is "robin" or $mpTownAtticOutcome is "keep">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($english or 0), ($history or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 650 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2100>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1200>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 800>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome is "bailey" or $mpTownAtticOutcome is "roof">><<set _reward to Math.floor(_reward / 2)>><</if>>
你把活板门合上，木梯收回原位。
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome is "robin">>
罗宾把日记抱在胸前，没有立刻翻开。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "keep">>
你把日记藏在自己的枕头下。那天夜里，你梦见一口井。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "return">>
皮箱重新合上，铜链绕回原来的位置。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "bailey">>
贝利没有碰箱子，只让你下楼。第二天阁楼多了一把新锁，钥匙不在你手里。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "roof">>
你从气窗翻到屋檐上，顺着排水管滑下去。手掌磨破了，但日记还在怀里。
<<else>>
你含糊地说了句找旧衣服。贝利看了你一会儿，转身下楼。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome isnot "bailey">>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_attic_complete")>>
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $mpClues["town_attic_gear"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_attic_gear")>>
		<<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	你只来得及藏起那束干花。日记留在了箱子里。
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从这只旧箱子里得到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
你把日记重新翻了一遍，箱底已经没有新的东西。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好东西离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼活板门 (0:03)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestClocktower or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	钟表旧货铺的门铃响了一声。
满墙挂钟各走各的，滴答声挤在一起。塞拉站在柜台后面，正用一块麂皮擦镜片。
	「别碰那只，」她头也不抬，「它走得比谁都准，只是不肯走。」
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[问塞拉怀表的来历 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<set $mpTownClockSera to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[看柜台下面的零件匣 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<set $mpTownClockParts to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<shopicon>><<link [[买一只旧齿轮 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<set $mpTownClockBought to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<pass 4>><<money -300>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	怀表还在柜台角落。塞拉把镜片夹回眼前，假装没在看你。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回到柜台 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	你已经把怀表的后盖撬松了一条缝。塞拉去了里间找零件。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续看表芯 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	怀表上的铭文已经很清楚了。钟塔的报时声从街口传来。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去钟塔基座 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	钟塔基座后面的石阶还在。铁栅上挂着新锁。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[靠近铁栅 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	暗格里的黄铜发条匣已经露出来。街口有人朝这边走。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[取出匣子 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	发条匣在你怀里轻轻发烫。钟塔顶上的铜针还在转。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	钟表铺的怀表已经被你查清。塞拉把它收回柜台，指针依然停在十二点零五分。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼怀表 (0:03)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 2)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockSera is 1>>
	塞拉把怀表翻过来，指着底盖边缘一道极细的撬痕。
	「有人开过它，没开完。」她说，「里面的音簧不是原配。你听。」
	她把表贴到你耳边。你听见一声很轻的嗡鸣，像很远的地方有人在敲钟。
<<elseif $mpTownClockParts is 1>>
	零件匣里全是拆下来的旧齿轮。你翻到最下面，摸到一只比别的都薄的黄铜片，边缘刻着钟塔的轮廓。
	<<set $mpClues["town_clock_parts"] to 1>>
<<else>>
	塞拉收下钱，从柜台底下摸出一只旧齿轮推给你：「拿去玩。别把表拆了。」
	<<set $mpClues["town_clock_spare"] to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "读夹底铭文 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_clock_open"] to 1>>
	你用薄刃沿撬痕轻轻一挑，底盖弹开。表芯里多出一层夹底，夹底上刻着一行拉丁文。
	<<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[读夹底铭文 (0:07)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[请塞拉看铭文 (0:06)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"] to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[先量齿轮间距 (0:06)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_measure"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownClockScratch to 1>>
	薄刃滑了一下，在你虎口划出一道细口。塞拉抬头看了一眼，没说话，只把放大镜往你这边推了推。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[垫稳重心再试 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] or $mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"]>>
	铭文的意思是「正午之后，第五分钟归塔」。塞拉说，这是旧钟塔建成时的校准语，知道它的人不超过三个。
<<else>>
	你没读懂那行字，但齿轮的咬合间距和钟塔外壁的浮雕刻度一模一样。你数出七个齿距，正好对应塔基的七块条石。
<</if>>
塞拉把怀表收回绒布上，忽然说：「今晚塔里有人换班。你要去，就别走正门。」
她没问你去干什么。
<br><br>
<<set $mpClues["town_clock_tower"] to 1>>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[趁夜色去钟塔 (0:08)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<pass 8>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<stress 1>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[请塞拉一起去 (0:09)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<set $mpTownClockSeraHelp to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 1>><</if>><<pass 9>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
钟塔基座后面的石阶被铁栅封着。锁是新的，锁孔里却有一点点旧油。
<<if $mpTownClockSeraHelp is 1>>
	塞拉站在街角替你望风，围巾遮住半张脸。她朝铁栅抬了抬下巴，示意你快一点。
<<else>>
	街口的路灯把铁栅的影子拉得很长。远处有巡夜的脚步声，规律地靠近。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回高街 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step4">
<<investigateicon>><<link "推门进去 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_clock_gate"] to 1>>
	锁舌弹开，铁栅只响了一声。你侧身钻进去，把铁栅虚掩回原位。
	<<stress 1>>
石阶向下，转了两个弯，停在一扇包铁木门前。门缝里透出暖黄的光。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[推门进去 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[先听里面的动静 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5]]>><<set $mpTownClockListen to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownClockAlarm to 1>>
	锁芯卡了一下，铁栅撞在石阶上，声音在塔基里来回撞。巡夜的脚步立刻停了。
	<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动手指再试 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
门后是一间圆形的机括室。墙上的铜管一根根伸进石壁，中央的控制盘上嵌着七个可以按下的黄铜键。控制盘下方有一块活动的浮雕石砖，边缘磨得发亮。
<<if $mpTownClockListen is 1>>
	你听见铜管里有人在说话，声音很小，像从很远的地方传过来。其中一个说「第五分钟」，另一个说「别让塞拉知道」。
	<<set $mpClues["town_clock_voice"] to 1>>
<<elseif $mpTownClockAlarm is 1>>
	上面的铁栅又响了一下。有人在塔外停住了。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[按齿距校准铜键 (0:08)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($science or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_calibrate"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTownClockSlow to 1>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先撬开活动石砖 (0:06)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6]]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_brick"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回高街 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
石砖弹开，里面是一只黄铜发条匣。匣盖上刻着和怀表夹底一样的拉丁文。你把它捧出来时，整间机括室的铜管同时低鸣了一声。
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_voice"]>>
	铜管里的声音停了。片刻后，有人从塔上往下走。
<<else>>
	塔顶的钟忽然敲了一下。不是整点。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[带着匣子从石阶退走 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "leave">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[只抄下匣盖铭文 (0:07)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "copy">><<set $mpClues["town_clock_copy"] to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把匣子放回原处 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "return">><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpTownClockSeraHelp is 1>>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把匣子交给塞拉 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "sera">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回高街 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_clock_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_open"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] or $mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_gate"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_voice"] or $mpClues["town_clock_calibrate"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "copy" or $mpTownClockOutcome is "sera">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($maths or 0), ($science or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2400>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1800>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1300>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 900>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "return">><<set _reward += 300>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "sera">><<set _reward += 200>><</if>>
你回到高街时，钟塔的指针已经走过了十二点零五分。
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "leave">>
你没把发条匣拿出来。塞拉看了你一眼，什么也没问。
<<elseif $mpTownClockOutcome is "copy">>
你把抄下的铭文摊在柜台上。塞拉用放大镜看了一遍，手指在「第五分钟」几个字上停了很久。
<<elseif $mpTownClockOutcome is "return">>
发条匣回到石砖后面。钟塔的铜管在你离开时轻轻响了一声，像有人松了一口气。
<<elseif $mpTownClockOutcome is "sera">>
塞拉把发条匣收进柜台下的铁盒，又把钥匙放进自己围裙口袋。
<<else>>
你从塔里出来时，街口的巡夜人已经走了。发条匣在怀里一下一下地轻震，像一颗很小的心。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome isnot "return" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_clock_complete")>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_open"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_clock_gear")>>
	<<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从钟塔的暗格里得到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
你再次检查发条匣，里面只剩先前抄过的铭文。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好铭文离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回看钟塔 (0:03)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestSmuggler or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
傍晚的港口飘着柴油和咸鱼混在一起的味道。
一个穿短打的男人正蹲在箱边，用粉笔在箱角画记号。
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[跟上去看他画什么 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<set $mpTownDocksFollow to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[找码头工打听 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<set $mpTownDocksAsk to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<pass 5>><<money -100>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[爬上集装箱顶 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<set $mpTownDocksClimb to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	集装箱后面的粉笔记号还没有被擦掉。海风把防雨布吹得啪啪响。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回到集装箱后 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	你已经记住了记号的样子。值班室的灯在栈桥尽头亮着。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去值班室 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	值班室的窗台上摊着一本货单。外面传来夜航船的汽笛。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[翻货单 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	夜航船靠上了三号泊位。跳板还没放稳，已经有人开始往下搬东西。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[靠近三号泊位 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	底舱的灯灭了。你听见有人在里面低声说话。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[摸到底舱 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	你带着货单和底舱里看到的东西退到栈桥阴影里。探照灯正朝这边扫过来。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[从栈桥撤走 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	三号泊位的夜航船已经离港。集装箱后面的粉笔记号被雨水冲淡了。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼空泊位 (0:03)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开集装箱区 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 2)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksFollow is 1>>
你贴着集装箱的阴影跟了半条栈桥。男人在第三只箱子前停下，用鞋尖踢了踢箱底。
	他走开后，你在箱角看见一个三角形加两道水波纹的记号，和货单上印的普通咸鱼标记不一样。
	<<set $mpClues["town_docks_mark"] to 1>>
<<elseif $mpTownDocksAsk is 1>>
老码头工收了你的钱，往手心啐了一口，压低声音说：「三角加水波，是夜航船的私货。」
	他指了指值班室：「货单在窗台上，自己去瞧。」
	<<set $mpClues["town_docks_mark"] to 1>>
<<else>>
你爬上集装箱顶，从防雨布的破口往下看。男人在箱角画完记号，又从怀里摸出一张折过的纸。
	你记住了纸角露出的半个船名：白鸥。
	<<set $mpClues["town_docks_mark"] to 1>>
	<<stress 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开集装箱区 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "去值班室看货单 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 220>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_docks_seal"] to 1>>
你用刀尖挑开箱角的一块铅封，里面塞着防潮的油纸。
	<<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[去值班室看货单 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[先躲开喊话的人 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownDocksNoise to 1>>
	铅封比你想的硬。刀尖一滑，在箱面上划出一道白痕。栈桥那头有人喊了一声。
	<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[调整手法再试 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
值班室的门没锁。屋里只有一张桌子、一只铁皮柜和一盏罩着报纸的灯。货单摊在窗台上，最上面一页写着「咸鱼、绳具、空桶」。
你翻到第二页，箱号、重量和泊位时间都对得上，唯独三号泊位那一栏的收货人写着「代收」。
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>>
	「代收」旁边的记号，和你在集装箱上看到的一模一样。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对重量 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_weight"] to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_numbers"] to 1>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[翻铁皮柜找底单 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4]]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_ledger"] to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 2>><</link>>
