:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
夜航船靠上三号泊位时，栈桥上的灯只亮了一半。跳板搭稳后，两个水手先下去，第三个人留在船头，手里提着一盏蒙布的风灯。
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_weight"]>>
	货单上的重量比咸鱼该有的重了将近三倍。你几乎能确定，底舱里装的是别的东西。
<<else>>
	你抄下的箱号里，有三个不在今晚的卸货清单上。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[从船尾爬上去 (0:08)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_board"] to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[借龙门吊阴影靠近 (0:07)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_shadow"] to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[先去通知巡港 (0:09)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<set $mpTownDocksPatrol to 1>><<pass 9>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开栈桥 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksPatrol is 1>>
	巡港的老水手听你说完，只问了一句「三号泊位？」就吹响了哨子。栈桥上立刻乱起来，夜航船开始收跳板。
	你趁乱从船尾翻上去，底舱门没锁。
<<else>>
	你从船尾摸上甲板，顺着货舱口的铁梯往下。底舱里点着一盏风灯，灯下堆着没有标记的木箱，箱子后面传来很轻的咳嗽声。
<</if>>
<br><br>
箱子后面绑着一个人。嘴被布条勒住，手腕上留着绳印。那人看见你时，眼睛先是一亮，接着拼命摇头，示意你别出声。
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[先解开绳子 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<set $mpTownDocksFree to 1>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_captive"] to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先翻箱找货单 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_manifest"] to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[把箱子挪开 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<set $mpTownDocksBox to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回甲板 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksFree is 1>>
	布条松开后，那人咳了很久才说出话。那人是前一条夜航船的记账员，因为看见不该看的货单被关在这里。
	「三号舱底有夹层，」那人抓着你的手腕，「他们今晚要转船。你要么现在走，要么跟我一起把夹层打开。」
<<elseif $mpClues["town_docks_manifest"]>>
	你在箱底翻出一本浸过油的货单。最后一页写着「转船：白鸥—雾角」，下面是一串人名，其中两个被红笔圈过。
<<else>>
	你挪开箱子，后面是一块活动的舱板。板下藏着几只皮袋和一把带海盐的短刀。
<</if>>
<br><br>
甲板上传来脚步声。有人正在往下走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回甲板 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step6">
<<sneakicon>><<link "吹灭风灯躲进空箱后 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step6">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_docks_escape"] to 1>>
	你灭掉风灯，把舱门虚掩，拉着那人躲进空箱后面。下来的人踢了两脚箱子，骂了一句，又上去了。
	<<stress 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[带人从船尾下船 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "free">><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[只带货单离开 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "evidence">><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[把夹层重新封好 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "seal">><<pass 6>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownDocksCaught to 1>>
	风灯被你不小心碰倒。灯油泼在木板上，火苗窜起来，甲板上的人立刻朝舱口跑来。
	<<stress 7>><<pain 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把舱门反锁 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "lock">><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[从舷窗跳海 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "sea">><<pass 6>><<pain 3>><<stress 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[举货单谈条件 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "deal">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_docks_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_seal"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_weight"] or $mpClues["town_docks_ledger"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_captive"] or $mpClues["town_docks_manifest"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_escape"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($athletics or 0), ($maths or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2600>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1900>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1400>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 950>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksOutcome is "deal" or $mpTownDocksOutcome is "sea">><<set _reward to Math.floor(_reward / 2)>><</if>>
你从栈桥阴影里退出来时，三号泊位的灯还亮着。
<<if $mpTownDocksOutcome is "free">>
被你解开绳子的人混在卸货工里下了船。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "evidence">>
	你只带了货单。底舱里的咳嗽声在你离开后停了很久，又轻轻响起来。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "seal">>
你把夹层重新封好，连箱角的粉笔灰都抹平了。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "lock">>
你把舱门反锁，听着外面的人撞了两下门。底舱里的人还在。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "sea">>
海水比你想的冷。你从防波堤的石阶爬上来时，货单已经湿透。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "deal">>
你把货单举到灯下，对方看了一眼。你没问底舱里的人怎么办，对方也没说。
<<else>>
	你趁乱从船尾滑下去，底舱里的声音被海浪盖住。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksOutcome isnot "deal" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_docks_complete")>>
	<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_captive"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_docks_ring")>>
	<<set $mpFragSmugglerRing to ($mpFragSmugglerRing or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从这次夜航里得到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
三号泊位已经换了船，你手里只剩上次抄下的货单。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好货单离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼三号泊位 (0:03)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestLibrary or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
图书馆最里侧的旧档案架下积着一层薄灰。西德尼抱着一摞待归架的书从过道那头走来，看见你蹲在那里。
「那几册不在借阅目录里，」西德尼说，「雷顿先生每学期都会来查一次。」
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[问西德尼那些卷宗 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<set $mpTownSchoolSydney to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[趁没人抽出卷宗 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<set $mpTownSchoolSneak to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[等到闭馆 (0:08)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<set $mpTownSchoolLate to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
无编号卷宗还在档案架底层。西德尼已经推着书车去了另一排。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回到档案架 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
卷宗摊在阅览桌上。纸页间夹着几张没有署名的照片。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续翻卷宗 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
装订线里那张硫酸纸图已经抽出来一半。图书馆的闭馆铃响了。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把图展开 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
图上标着图书馆与旧钟塔之间的夹墙连廊。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去夹墙连廊 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
连廊尽头的石台上放着一只铁盒。盒盖上的校徽被人用刀划掉了。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[打开铁盒 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
铁盒里的东西已经在你手里。走廊那头传来雷顿先生的脚步声。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[从连廊退出去 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
夹墙连廊已经被你走通。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼铁盒 (0:03)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开图书馆 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 2)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolSydney is 1>>
	西德尼把书车停在过道口，替你挡住管理员的视线。
	「我只知道一件事，」西德尼低声说，「十年前有个毕业班，照片墙上没有他们。校刊里也查不到。」
	<<set $mpClues["town_school_class"] to 1>>
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolLate is 1>>
	闭馆铃响过之后，图书馆只剩应急灯。你从档案架底层抽出卷宗，灰尘在灯下像一层细雪。
<<else>>
	你趁管理员转身，把最厚的一册卷宗抽出来。书脊裂了一道口，里面掉出半张照片。
	<<stress 1>>
<</if>>
卷宗里是十年前的教学记录。班级名单、成绩册、郊游申请都齐全，唯独毕业照那一页被整齐地撕掉了。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对年份 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClues["town_school_year"] to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去问西德尼毕业班的事 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step3]]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_sydney"] to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开图书馆 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

