<<if $mpClues["town_school_transfer"]>>
	西德尼说，转走的学生里有三个后来在神殿和孤儿院的记录里出现过。你想起账册上的缩写。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[现在就进夹墙 (0:08)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<pass 8>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<set $mpClues["town_school_wall"] to 1>><<stress 2>><<else>><<set $mpClues["town_school_wall"] to 1>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
