<<getouticon>><<link [[离开图书馆 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
