	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
古籍架侧面的黄铜烛台就是机关。你按图上的方向旋了半圈，书架向后让出一道只容一人侧身通过的缝。
夹墙里没有灯，空气干冷。墙皮上留着粉笔写的日期，越往里越密。尽头的石台上放着一只铁盒，盒盖上的校徽被刀划掉了。
<<if $mpTownSchoolSydneyHelp is 1>>
	西德尼跟在你身后，手里举着一盏从阅览室带出来的小灯。西德尼没说话，但呼吸很浅。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回图书馆 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-school-archives-step5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "翻学生档案 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-school-archives-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_school_box"] to 1>>
	铁盒的锁很简单。你拨开锁舌，盒里是一叠学生档案和一把小钥匙。
	<<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[翻学生档案 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step6]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[先听墙外的动静 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Step6]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolListen to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownSchoolNoise to 1>>
	锁扣弹了一下，铁盒从石台上滑下去，砸在地上。声音在夹墙里传得很远。
	<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准动静再试 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest School Archives Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
档案里的学生照片都被剪掉了一角。每份档案后面都附着一张转学许可，签字栏是同一个名字：L. 雷顿。
最底下压着一份没写完的报告，标题是「关于钟塔地下回声的初步记录」。最后一行只有半句：『他们不是转学，是被——』
<<if $mpTownSchoolListen is 1>>
	墙外传来雷顿先生的声音。他在问管理员，今晚谁最后一个离开图书馆。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[带着档案从连廊走 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "take">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[只抄下名单 (0:07)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "copy">><<set $mpClues["town_school_names"] to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把档案交给西德尼 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "sydney">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把铁盒放回石台 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "return">><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回图书馆 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_school_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_class"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_year"] or $mpClues["town_school_photo"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_map"] or $mpClues["town_school_transfer"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_box"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "copy" or $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "sydney">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($history or 0), ($english or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2200>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1700>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1200>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 800>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "return">><<set _reward += 300>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "sydney">><<set _reward += 200>><</if>>
你从夹墙退回图书馆，把书架推回原位。闭馆后的走廊只剩应急灯，光从门缝里漏进来。
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "take">>
学生档案在你怀里硌得慌。你从侧门出去时，雷顿先生正站在走廊尽头。
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "copy">>
你把名单抄在一张借书卡的背面。原件放回铁盒，连折角都照原样压平。
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "sydney">>
西德尼接过档案，手指在「L. 雷顿」的签名上停了一会儿。
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "return">>
铁盒回到石台上。你只带走了那张硫酸纸图，图上的「禁闭室」三个字被你的指温蹭得有点模糊。
<<else>>
你从夹墙出来时，图书馆已经锁门了。你在侧门等了一会儿，才等到巡夜人经过。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome isnot "return" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_school_complete")>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从这届被抹掉的学生档案里得到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
夹墙里的铁盒已经空了，你只又核对了一遍名单。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好名单离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[再看一眼档案架 (0:03)|MP Quest School Archives]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestCatacomb or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
神殿侧廊的青铜烛台底座有一圈新鲜的刮痕。
	「你也听见了？」乔丹问，「昨晚的钟声。不是塔上的那口。」
	乔丹把灯放在烛台旁边，没有点。
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[问乔丹钟声的事 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<set $mpTownTempleJordan to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[转动烛台底座 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<set $mpTownTempleTurn to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[留在侧廊听钟声 (0:08)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<set $mpTownTempleListen to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	侧廊的烛台已经被你转过半圈。石壁后面的冷风从缝里渗出来。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[推开石板 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	石阶向下，尽头有一点微弱的烛光。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走下石阶 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	地下墓穴的石壁上刻满了雾月之蚀的壁画。祭台暗龛里有一只银质圣油瓶。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走近祭台 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	暗龛后面的石门开了一条缝。里面有人在低声念诵。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[靠近石门 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	石门后的念诵停了。你听见脚步声朝门口走来。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[藏到祭台后面 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	地下墓穴的冷风从暗河方向吹来。你已经拿到了能拿的东西。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[从石阶退回去 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	地下墓穴已经被你走遍。祭台暗龛空着，石壁上的壁画还在烛光里发暗。
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[再看一眼壁画 (0:03)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 2)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleJordan is 1>>
	乔丹把灯递给你，自己没有跟下来。
	「下面有一段路，灯会灭，」乔丹说，「听见有人叫你名字，别应。」
	<<set $mpClues["town_temple_warning"] to 1>>
<<elseif $mpTownTempleListen is 1>>
	你留在侧廊等钟声。第二声响起时，烛台底座自己转了半圈，石壁后传来铁链绷紧的声音。
<<else>>
	你双手握住烛台底座，向右拧了半圈。石壁里传来铁链滑轮收紧的声响，一块浮雕石板向内滑开。
<</if>>
石阶向下，冷风里带着没药和旧檀香。你走到一半，手里的光忽然暗了一下。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[稳住呼吸继续走 (0:07)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step3]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_nerve"] to 1>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[在石阶上停一停 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step3]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
地下墓穴比上面的神殿更旧。石壁上的壁画一层压着一层，最上面一层画的是雾月之蚀：月亮被一条细线切开，线下面站着七个人。
祭台暗龛里放着一只红蜡封口的银质圣油瓶，旁边是半卷羊皮祝祷文。
<<if $mpTownTempleFear is 1>>
	你的手还在抖。壁画上那些人的脸被烛光一照，像是都在看你。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[读壁画铭文 (0:07)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step4]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($history or 0) gte 280 or ($english or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_mural"] to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_rubbing"] to 1>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[先看圣油瓶 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step4]]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_oil"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_mural"]>>
	铭文说，雾月之蚀那晚，七个人会在地下等一个「替他们记住名字的人」。壁画最下方有一排被刮掉的名字，只剩首字母。
<<elseif $mpClues["town_temple_rubbing"]>>
	你拓下的下缘有一行很小的字：『第七次钟响，门开向水。』
<<else>>
	圣油瓶的蜡封上有七个凹痕，像是被七枚不同的戒指按过。
<</if>>
暗龛后面的石门没有锁，只靠一块石头顶着。门缝里有人在低声念诵，声音很平，像在数数。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-temple-catacomb-step4">
<<sneakicon>><<link "从门缝看进去 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-temple-catacomb-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["town_temple_door"] to 1>>
	你把顶门的石头一点点挪开，门只响了一声。念诵没有停。
	<<stress 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[从门缝看进去 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[先退到祭台后 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step5]]>><<set $mpTownTempleHide to 1>><<pass 4>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownTempleStone to 1>>
	石头滑了一下，砸在你的脚背上。门里的念诵停了。
	<<pain 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
石门后是一间圆形的暗室，地上刻着一圈名字。七个穿灰袍的人围着圈站，脸都藏在兜帽里。他们念的不是祷词，是名字。
念到第三个名字时，其中一个人抬起头，朝门缝这边看过来。
<br><br>
<<if $mpTownTempleHide is 1>>
	你缩在祭台后面，听见灰袍人开始往门口走。脚步很慢，但没有停。
<<else>>
	你和那个抬头的人对上了视线。那人没有喊，只是抬起手，朝你招了招。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[站着不动 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_stand"] to 1>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[沿墙退回石门 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<set $mpTownTempleRetreat to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[开口问他们是谁 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_ask"] to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleLocked is 1>>
	石门在你身后合上了。暗室里没有风，烛火却一起矮了下去。灰袍人没有靠近，只是继续念名字。
	你听见自己的名字被夹在中间，念得很轻，像怕惊动什么。
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[跟着念祷词 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "pray">><<set $mpClues["town_temple_pray"] to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[找墙缝里的风 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "draft">><<set $mpClues["town_temple_draft"] to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[撬开石门底缝 (0:07)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "pry">><<pass 7>><<pain 3>><<stress 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[喊乔丹的名字 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "jordan">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $mpTownTempleRetreat is 1>>
		你沿墙退回石门，灰袍人没有追。门外的石阶上，乔丹留下的灯还亮着。
	<<elseif $mpClues["town_temple_ask"]>>
		你问他们是谁。念诵停了。离你最近的人摘下兜帽，露出一张很年轻的脸。
		「我们是名字，」那人说，「被写下来，就不会散。」
	<<else>>
		你站着没动。灰袍人看了你一会儿，继续念名字。念到第七个时，暗室尽头的石门自己开了。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[拿走圣油瓶 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "oil">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[抄下七个名字 (0:07)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "names">><<set $mpClues["town_temple_names"] to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[留下灯离开 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "leave">><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_temple_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_warning"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_mural"] or $mpClues["town_temple_rubbing"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_door"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_stand"] or $mpClues["town_temple_ask"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_names"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($history or 0), ($english or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2300>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1750>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1250>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 850>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleOutcome is "pray" or $mpTownTempleOutcome is "leave">><<set _reward += 250>><</if>>
你沿着石阶回到侧廊，把烛台转回原位。
<<if $mpTownTempleOutcome is "oil">>
	银质圣油瓶被你裹在布里。瓶里的油很凉，隔着布也能感觉到。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "names">>
你把七个名字抄在祝祷文的背面。写到最后一个时，笔尖停了一下。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "leave">>
你把灯留在祭台边。走出石门时，身后的念诵声轻了一拍。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "draft">>
你顺着墙缝里的冷风找到一条窄道，从暗河渡口的方向绕回石阶。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "pry">>
石门底部被你撬开一条缝。你从缝里挤出去时，手背被石棱刮掉一层皮。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "jordan">>
乔丹的声音从石阶上方传下来。灰袍人停了念诵，石门自己开了。
<<else>>
你跟着念完最后一句。暗室里的烛火重新亮起来，灰袍人一个个摘下兜帽。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleOutcome isnot "oil" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_temple_complete")>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_mural"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_temple_page")>>
	<<set $mpFragAbyssPage to ($mpFragAbyssPage or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从地下墓穴里得到约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -6>><<trauma -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
暗室里的灰袍人已经散了，你只又看了一遍抄下的名字。
<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好东西回廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[再看一眼烛台 (0:03)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
